{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40721","headline":"毙驴 · 李洞","name":"毙驴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹇驴秋毙瘗荒田，忍把敲吟旧竹鞭。\n三尺焦桐背残月，一条藜杖卓寒烟。\n通吴白浪宽围果，倚蜀青山峭入天。\n如画海门搘肘望，阿谁家卖钓鱼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}